-    //      browsers CEF calls CefLifeSpanHandler.doClose() which calls
-    //      CefBrowser.doClose() again which returns false (allowing the close).
-    //   7. CEF calls CefLifeSpanHandler.onBeforeClose and the browser is destroyed.
